    <string name="contact">Contact support</string>
    <string name="credits">Credits</string>
    <string name="credits_body">Place data: GeoNames (geonames.org), CC BY 4.0.\nAdhan 1: \"Beautiful adhan\" by Adam-synagda, Wikimedia Commons, CC0 1.0.\nAdhan 2: \"Azan\" by Andrewler, Wikimedia Commons, CC BY-SA 4.0.\nTypeface: Readex Pro, SIL Open Font License 1.1.</string>
    <string name="support_title">Support the app</string>
    <string name="support_body">If you find Salah Times Only useful, you can optionally support its development.</string>
    <string name="privacy_1">Salah Times Only does not require an account and does not collect personal information, prayer history or usage analytics.</string>
    <string name="privacy_2">Your selected location and settings are stored only on your device. Prayer times and the Qibla direction are calculated on your device, so your location is never sent to a server.</string>
    <string name="privacy_3">If you choose \"Use my current location\", your position is read once to find the nearest city. It is not stored beyond your selected location and is not shared.</string>
    <string name="privacy_4">The app contains no advertising and no third-party trackers.</string>
